('bahmni.appointment.teleConsultation.patientEmailNotificationTemplate','Hi {0}, Your tele-consultation appointment with {1} for {2} has been scheduled! Please use this link {3}. If you have any questions, please reach out to administration for assistance. See you soon!','Template to use while sending mail. Format is define like in Java MessageFormat','84983fd4-d5fc-49a2-9219-fe7c126a8ba7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
